    LLM: '1. Deal: 12 cards each, 6 in blind. 2. Bidding; bidder calls a King for partner (not trump XIX). 3. Play 12 tricks clockwise; follow suit, trump if void. 4. Score: count cards in packets of three, subtract 2 per packet; bonuses for declared combinations. Settlements after each hand.',
